      "context_excerpt": "Researchers across Taiwan are tackling complex challenges in AI development, climate science and quantum computing. Their work will soon be boosted by a new supercomputer at Taiwan’s National Center for High-Performance Computing that’s set to deliver over 8x more AI performance than the center’s earlier Taiwania 2 system .",
